Rubik latin-ext URL same for all weights? Variable font? Seems same. We'll download Bungee latin-ext+latin (same file? no). Rubik latin-ext and latin. Use local @font-face with normal weights? Rubik file likely variable? It's woff2 maybe contains all weights but CSS not declared variable? Since same URL for 400/600/700/800, yes variable. But with separate @font-face per weight could load same. Set one @font-face with font-weight 300 900? Woff2 maybe variable. Do:
```
@font-face Bungee src local; 
@font-face Rubik src ...; font-weight: 300 900;
```
Could work. Need Turkish chars: latin-ext for ğ,ş,İ,ı,ç,ö,ü. Unicodes U+011E etc in latin-ext (U+0100-02BA). Basic ç,ö,ü are latin. Turkish İ U+0130 in latin, ı U+0131 latin, ğ U+011F / ş U+015F in latin-ext. Need both files; browser will select per glyph. Include two @font-face with unicode-range. But both same family/weight. Good.
